## نوبت‌آرا: Independent Barber Platform

- **Multi-barber platform**, not a single salon
- Each barber has their own:
  - Working hours schedule
  - Services list with individual prices
  - Customer bookings
  - Unique barber code for customer access

## User Roles

1. **Customers**: Telegram-only (book via bot with barber code)
2. **Barbers**: Web panel at `/barber/*` (view bookings, manage services/hours)
3. **Super Admin**: Web panel at `/admin/*` (manage all barbers, system-wide view)

## Super Admin on Barber Pages

- Super admin can access `/barber/*` routes
- Show «بازگشت به داشبورد ادمین» link to return to `/admin`

## Services Management

- Inactive services remain in database/list
- Inactive services are NOT bookable via Telegram
- Barbers can toggle service active/inactive status
